From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Zuasti <rzuasti@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: report what a contacts sync saved

`Received::Contacts` carries the sync's `complete` flag and the contacts
saved, or `None` if the list couldn't be read, parsed or saved in full,
so clients can drop contacts the primary device no longer has. Entries
without an ACI are skipped, as before.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
